# Optional. Without these the game state lives in memory - perfect for local
# development, but on Vercel/Netlify several serverless instances would each
# keep their own copy. See README section 2 (Storage).
#
# Vercel + Upstash integration sets these two automatically:
# KV_REST_API_URL=
# KV_REST_API_TOKEN=
#
# Upstash directly (e.g. on Netlify):
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
